                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e395d899-8514-3e3b-8834-84ded1912856",
                        "entry_id": "daec7159-5d7b-3d19-9333-11cf7e4a6f8b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Bezeichnung für verschiedene starrkrampfartige Arten der Bewegungsarmut mit und ohne Steigerung des Muskeltonus"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ca623bb5-95eb-4f45-90a2-bdb879dd2f57",
                                "sense_id": "e395d899-8514-3e3b-8834-84ded1912856",
                                "text": "„Die Legendenerzählung berichtet, wie der stolze und leichtlebige Ritter plötzlich in Katalepsie fällt und drei Tage lang wie tot da liegt.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ad1b287e-61a8-41f6-a32d-680bceb60bc0",
                        "source_entry_id": "daec7159-5d7b-3d19-9333-11cf7e4a6f8b",
                        "source_sense_id": "e395d899-8514-3e3b-8834-84ded1912856",
                        "target_lang_word": "catalepsy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "catalepsy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aafd0885-ea2e-36b3-93dc-1f5d01a879a1",
                                        "entry_id": "75d180e2-fac0-3b22-a700-150aa493d44a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A severe bodily condition, described in psychiatric pathology, marked by sudden rigidity, fixation of posture, and loss of contact with environmental conditions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56a4da62-7dc6-43d2-aeea-4001abc2ad06",
                                                "sense_id": "aafd0885-ea2e-36b3-93dc-1f5d01a879a1",
                                                "text": "\"But they could not have been asleep!\" cried Lord John. \"Dash it all, Challenger, you don't mean to believe that those folk were asleep with their staring eyes and stiff limbs and that awful death grin on their faces!\" \"It can only have been the condition that is called catalepsy,\" said Challenger."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3d29bf0-f5ec-4a72-8e1b-e7e4ca2b2f1c",
                                                "sense_id": "aafd0885-ea2e-36b3-93dc-1f5d01a879a1",
                                                "text": "I was furious with Edgar Allan Poe for writing so accurately about this. His tales of catalepsy and live burial poisoned my childhood, and still killed me."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a4ba9a96-a544-4db2-a95c-f85c37b71db3",
                        "source_entry_id": "daec7159-5d7b-3d19-9333-11cf7e4a6f8b",
                        "source_sense_id": "e395d899-8514-3e3b-8834-84ded1912856",
                        "target_lang_word": "catalepsie",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "catalepsie",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5f2a58cf-c4d1-3f51-98da-0232a6033132",
                                        "entry_id": "bb3460b3-dd4a-3db6-9c29-01d0772f3861",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Suspension complète des sensations et des mouvements volontaires, avec aptitude des membres et du tronc à conserver la position qu’on leur donne."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfaa8963-0c96-42d0-8eb0-fe05b6b9bf22",
                                                "sense_id": "5f2a58cf-c4d1-3f51-98da-0232a6033132",
                                                "text": "Et je commençais à me rendre un compte exact de mon état. Il devait s’agir d’un de ces cas de catalepsie dont j’avais entendu parler. Déjà, quand j’étais enfant, à l’époque de ma grande maladie nerveuse, j’avais eu des syncopes de plusieurs heures."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e870f80c-e28b-4b51-a3a3-bcefc5a3457c",
                                                "sense_id": "5f2a58cf-c4d1-3f51-98da-0232a6033132",
                                                "text": "L’œil dilaté, il salue et, comme on tombe en catalepsie, tombe au garde à vous."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5642ef5-0cc6-4afe-8a93-fb128a3c02e9",
                                                "sense_id": "5f2a58cf-c4d1-3f51-98da-0232a6033132",
                                                "text": "Louis avait eu quelques accès de catalepsie bien caractérisés. Il était resté pendant cinquante-neuf heures immobile, les yeux fixes, sans manger ni parler ; état purement nerveux dans lequel tombent quelques personnes en proie à de violentes passions ; phénomène rare, mais dont les effets sont bien parfaitement connus des médecins."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb222da2-2d6e-4996-8b42-74ed76ccc65e",
                                                "sense_id": "5f2a58cf-c4d1-3f51-98da-0232a6033132",
                                                "text": "Voici le mal qui vient, je vais tomber en catalepsie"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56d31da6-2aa2-484d-83a0-9eaa14f3e987",
                                                "sense_id": "5f2a58cf-c4d1-3f51-98da-0232a6033132",
                                                "text": "Il parait que j’eus une rechute de catalepsie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9d2abd8f-357a-49d9-883d-89d5974b0ab5",
                        "source_entry_id": "daec7159-5d7b-3d19-9333-11cf7e4a6f8b",
                        "source_sense_id": "e395d899-8514-3e3b-8834-84ded1912856",
